{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43012","headline":"送道士曾昭莹 · 沈麟","name":"送道士曾昭莹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南北东西事，人间会也无。\n昔曾栖玉笥，今也返玄都。\n雪片随天阔，泉声落石孤。\n丹霄人有约，去采石菖蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈麟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}